      "text": {
        "fa": "برچسب: در شیردهی با احتیاط؛ متن برچسب را ببینید.",
        "en": "Label: use with caution while breastfeeding; see the label text."
      },
      "quote": "Risk Summary Bempedoic acid was detected in breast milk of lactating women who received six consecutive daily doses of 180 mg bempedoic acid.",
